        "entry_date": "2026-04-25",
        "title": "Drove out to the cape",
        "notes": "# Drove out to the cape\n\nLeft at 6:30. Beat the trail crowd by an hour. Trail head parking is gated until May 15, so we started from the lower lot — adds about a mile each way.\n\n- The bridge at mile 2 is washed out; detour adds 20 minutes\n- Bring the lighter jacket next time\n- The pancake place near the turnoff opens at 7am Sat/Sun only\n\nMet a couple from Eugene at the summit. They're doing a thru-hike in June — I want that.\n",
